{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/13478","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/13478/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/13478/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/13478/events","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/13478","id":751054678,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU3NTEwNTQ2Nzg=","number":13478,"title":"HTTP Server does not support `Expect: 100-continue`","user":{"login":"defnull","id":62740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull","html_url":"https://github.com/defnull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/defnull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":985346620,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5ODUzNDY2MjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/105","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/milestone/105","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/milestones/105/labels","id":6279762,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjI3OTc2Mg==","number":105,"title":"1.11.0.Final","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":74,"state":"closed","created_at":"2021-01-06T13:58:56Z","updated_at":"2021-07-28T09:26:20Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2021-01-20T11:47:55Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2020-11-25T19:01:48Z","updated_at":"2021-01-12T23:53:16Z","closed_at":"2021-01-12T20:31:50Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\nA `HTTP/1.1` request with `Expect: 100-continue` is not handled correctly by the HTTP server implementation (vert.x / undertow). This causes timeouts or delays for clients that follow the spec.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nThe HTTP server implementation should send `100 Continue` or an error response immediately, or at least as soon as the application tries to read from the message body. RFC 7231 5.1.1 states that an HTTP/1.1 server receiving `Expect: 100-continue` \"MUST NOT wait for the message body before sending the 100 (Continue) response.\"\r\n\r\n**Actual behavior**\r\nThe HTTP server implementation does not send `100 Continue` and waits for message body data. Strict clients will not send any data before they receive `100 Continue`, which never happens, causing a timeout. Less strict clients will wait for a certain time (curl waits for one second by default) and then send data anyway, assuming the server does not implement this part of the spec.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n1) Build a minimal jax-rs application that accepts PUT requests and the request body as an `InputStream`. Read from that input stream.\r\n2) Run `echo \"foo\" | curl -XPUT -T - --expect100-timeout 5 -v http://localhost:8080/path/to/endpoint`. The `-T -` trick forces curl into chunked `100-continue` mode.\r\n\r\nYou will notice a delay of 5 seconds while curl waits for `100 Continue`. More strict clients (e.g. ffmpeg http protocol handler) will just fail with a timeout, assuming the server is unresponsive.\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: 1.10.0.Final\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/13478/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/13478/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}